01:13:30.840 --> 01:13:31.760
So I did.

1487
01:13:32.020 --> 01:13:34.800
And he came up to me, and he was like, can you give me more?

1488
01:13:35.340 --> 01:13:36.040
I was like, what?

1489
01:13:36.280 --> 01:13:37.620
He was like, even harder.

1490
01:13:37.700 --> 01:13:41.700
I want you to, I just need the death stare of all death stares.

1491
01:13:41.980 --> 01:13:43.160
I did it again.

1492
01:13:43.160 --> 01:13:44.440
He's like, Angela, even more.

1493
01:13:44.560 --> 01:13:46.280
I wrote about it in my journal.

1494
01:13:46.280 --> 01:13:51.100
I said, Greg kept saying, one more time, Angela, more mad, more.

1495
01:13:51.420 --> 01:13:55.160
By the end, my eyeballs were shaking in my head.

1496
01:13:56.080 --> 01:13:59.040
I wrote down, Angela, did you get a headache?

1497
01:14:00.320 --> 01:14:00.840
Yes.

1498
01:14:01.040 --> 01:14:02.500
I had the sci-fi bun.

1499
01:14:02.640 --> 01:14:04.340
I was giving the super death stare.

1500
01:14:04.740 --> 01:14:09.440
And truly, by the end, I think you can ever so slightly see me shaking.

1501
01:14:09.720 --> 01:14:12.980
That's how, like, angry my stare is, that I'm like.

1502
01:14:12.980 --> 01:14:18.740
Like, I was curious if you, like, popped a blood vessel in your eyeball or something.

1503
01:14:18.740 --> 01:14:20.300
It is so intense.

1504
01:14:20.860 --> 01:14:22.020
I was about to.

1505
01:14:22.180 --> 01:14:22.880
I'm not kidding.

1506
01:14:23.220 --> 01:14:25.720
It is a great way to end the episode.

1507
01:14:26.480 --> 01:14:28.940
I do have a fan question, Angela.

1508
01:14:29.220 --> 01:14:29.620
Okay.

1509
01:14:29.800 --> 01:14:34.520
And I don't mean to unravel the entire plot of this show.

1510
01:14:34.700 --> 01:14:35.200
What?

1511
01:14:35.340 --> 01:14:36.540
But it's a good question.

1512
01:14:36.800 --> 01:14:37.120
Okay.

1513
01:14:37.660 --> 01:14:39.460
It comes from Grace D.

1514
01:14:40.400 --> 01:14:45.980
And she says, why couldn't Angela just bring her own tax forms to corporate?

1515
01:14:46.280 --> 01:14:48.560
She has too many cats, Grace.

1516
01:14:48.980 --> 01:14:54.700
Well, and also, we know from the deleted scenes, some, one of her cats just had a litter of kittens

1517
01:14:54.700 --> 01:14:55.880
that she's dealing with.

1518
01:14:56.060 --> 01:14:58.120
That was my first thought, too, Angela.

1519
01:14:58.320 --> 01:15:00.160
I was kind of stumped by that at firSt.

1520
01:15:00.300 --> 01:15:04.700
And I was like, yeah, why didn't Angela just go to New York herself?

1521
01:15:04.700 --> 01:15:10.740
But then I was like, no, she probably has, she probably gets up very early and has, like,

1522
01:15:10.860 --> 01:15:14.320
a 90-minute cat routine she has to do every morning.

1523
01:15:14.600 --> 01:15:14.780
Yes.

1524
01:15:14.800 --> 01:15:20.000
Putting ointment on eyes and medicines and grooming, right?

1525
01:15:20.380 --> 01:15:20.900
Yes.

1526
01:15:20.980 --> 01:15:25.440
And getting the litter boxes ready for the day and setting out food for all of them.

1527
01:15:25.620 --> 01:15:30.740
I think she has a full morning before she gets to work, and especially if she had a litter

1528
01:15:30.740 --> 01:15:31.320
of kittens.

1529
01:15:31.320 --> 01:15:35.160
And I think she was probably stressing out and going through this whole list with Dwight,

1530
01:15:35.260 --> 01:15:36.700
and he just said, I'll take them.

1531
01:15:36.840 --> 01:15:37.080
Don't worry.

1532
01:15:37.160 --> 01:15:37.580
I'll do it.

1533
01:15:37.620 --> 01:15:38.040
I'll do it.

1534
01:15:39.180 --> 01:15:40.400
Yes, that's right.

1535
01:15:40.620 --> 01:15:45.360
The choices for Dwight were take the forms to New York or do the cat care liSt.

1536
01:15:45.500 --> 01:15:48.480
And he was like, I choose forms to New York.

1537
01:15:48.720 --> 01:15:49.000
Yeah.

1538
01:15:49.300 --> 01:15:50.440
But good question, Grace.

1539
01:15:50.640 --> 01:15:51.640
I thought, valid question.

1540
01:15:51.800 --> 01:15:52.600
Valid question.

1541
01:15:52.840 --> 01:15:52.920
Valid question.

1542
01:15:53.960 --> 01:15:57.060
Well, lady, that is Traveling Salesman.

